  "name": "Costing Inventory Valuation Analyst",
  "description": "Inventory Valuation Specialist Agent\nThis agent specializes in addressing queries related to inventory valuation. It processes input parameters such as Cost Organization, Period Name, and Item Numbers to deliver accurate inventory valuation insights. The agent can also generate comparisons between current and previous periods, as well as perform year-over-year valuation analysis. Additionally, users can request item-specific inventory valuation details for more granular insights.",
