        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Inventory Valuation Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1760652826413",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1760652826415_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an Inventory Valuation Assistant.\n\nUsing {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output}} - inventory Value information to craft a 30-word financial update that reads like a brief for senior leadership.\nBegin with stating that as of today the inventory value stands at that amount converted to either thousands, millions or billions depending on its value. If there is a mismatch between the costed and accounted value, state that there is a reconciliation issue with the accounted number. Do not show any other data from the above output."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Using the provided data, compare the new and old figures and present the following:\n\n1. **Display Analysis with a MultiRecordWidget\nUse a multiRecordWidget with cols as \nMetric: (e.g., Total Inventory Value)\n<CurrentPeriod>: (e.g., Oct-25)\n<PriorPeriod>: (e.g., Sep-25)\nMoM\n<PreviousYearPriorPeriod>: (e.g., Oct-24)\nYoY\nReplace <CurrentPeriod>, <PriorPeriod>, and <PreviousYearPriorPeriod> with the actual period names.\n\n   ** Display a title in 8 words providing insight of the Inventory Valuation summary.\n   ** Always include a concise text summary (1-2 sentences) that highlights the key insights, patterns, or takeaways from the visualization. Place this summary immediately before the information display.\n   * Provide insights and trends based on the comparison of new vs. old data.\n  \n2. **Format for Amounts**:\n\n   * Convert the amounts to an appropriate scale (thousands, millions, or billions) based on the value.\n   * Include the relevant currency for each amount.\n\n3. **Display Data Rows**:\n\n   * Display 1 row with the following values for columns : *\n      1. Inventory Valuation,\n      2. Inventory Valuation for current Period, \n\n      3. Inventory Valuation for Prior Period \n\n      4. Include MoM (Month over month % Change using Inventory Valuation for current Period - Inventory Valuation for Prior Period) next to it. Display the percentage part in a badge. With negative % value as green, positive % value as red, no change % value as grey.\n          **Example: **85B USD (-10%)** Display the percentage change in a badge. With negative % value as green badge, positive % value as red badge, no change % value as grey badge.\n          *This represents the Inventory Valuation for the Prior Period, followed by the percentage change between the Current Period and Prior Period.*\n\n      5. Inventory Valuation for Prior Year Period  \n \n      6. Include YOY (Year over year % Change using Inventory Valuation for current Period - Inventory Valuation for Prior Year Period ) next to it. Display the percentage part in a badge. With negative % value as green, positive % value as red, no change % value as grey.\n          **Example: **90B USD (-5%)**  Display the percentage change in a badge. With negative % value as green badge, positive % value as red badge, no change % value as grey badge.\n          *This represents the Inventory Valuation for the Prior Year Period, followed by the percentage change between the Current Period and Prior Year Period.*"
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Inventory Valuation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INVENTORY_VALUATION",
          "id": "1770915052788",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770915052789_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a skilled Inventory Valuation Analyst.\nUsing the data from {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output}} and  {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output}}, analyze the inventory valuation changes across three key periods\n      1. The current accounting period - {{$context.$variables.periodName}} \n      2. The prior accounting period (Period Name)\n      3. The same month in the previous year {{$context.$variables.priorPeriodName}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
