              "value": "IF {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].AccountedMatch}} is \"N\" the user needs to run create accounting job to resolve the mismatch. \nSo generate an actionable insight with followUpCommand: ora.Agent(\"Run_Create_Accounting\"), and provide a shortDescription that clearly describes the problem. \nSet the actionText to \"Run Create Accounting\"."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
